 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-m4",
  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "draft_py": "# FDN Angelic Destiny.\n# \"Enchanted creature gets +4/+4, has flying and first strike, and is an Angel in addition to its\n# other types.\"  M21 Dub's B5a-enchant-pt-firststrike-knight (verified) with +4/+4, the two\n# keyword grants sorted by name (divergence D23) and the Angel type.\n# \"When enchanted creature dies, return this card to its owner's hand.\"  CreatureDiesEvent over the\n# enchanted creature (IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE, M21 Malefic Scythe's \"equipped creature\" dies form);\n# the Aura card, put into its owner's graveyard by CR 704.5m, is the source (IS_SOURCE) moved from\n# a graveyard to its owner's hand (Unsummon's owner hand).\nENCHANTED = Selector(\n    count=QUnbounded(),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nanthem = StaticAbility(\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n                'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=4)),\n                'target': ENCHANTED,\n                'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=4)),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.FIRST_STRIKE),\n                'target': ENCHANTED,\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.FLYING),\n                'target': ENCHANTED,\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_TYPE, {\n                'target': ENCHANTED,\n                'types': ('Angel',),\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\ncome_back = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=CreatureDiesEvent(filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE)),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=A(Verb.MOVE_ZONE, {\n        'cards': Selector(\n            count=QConst(value=1),\n            mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n            filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.GRAVEYARD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n        'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.HAND, controller=ControllerRef.OWNER),\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [anthem, come_back, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Enchant creature",
    "ir": "keywords[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Enchanted creature gets +4/+4, has flying and first strike, and is an Angel in addition to its other types.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "When enchanted creature dies, return this card to its owner's hand.",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "Static: Dub's form (verified) with +4/+4, the keyword grants sorted (D23) and the Angel type. Dies trigger: CreatureDiesEvent(IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE), the Aura card (IS_SOURCE) moved from a graveyard to its owner's hand. ENGINE (weaker than printed): the trigger never fires. binding.functions_from_graveyard reads a trigger whose effect moves its own source out of a graveyard as working only from the graveyard (CR 113.6m) and misses the rule's Aura exception ('... or, if the object is an Aura, that the object it enchants leaves the battlefield'): the ability is bound only once the Aura is in the graveyard, after the creature's death was matched. With the move's zone written as ANY instead (a wider, stronger reading, not used) the same pack passes. Packs: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/angelic_destiny_enchanted_creature_is_an_angel.json (support: FDN Lyra Dawnbringer, an M7 record), tools/scenarios/known_bugs/angelic_destiny_aura_never_returns_when_its_creature_dies.json (fails today)."
 },
